### Pedidos de prueba (extensión REST Client de VS Code, o copiar a Postman)

@base = http://localhost:3003/payments

### 1. Crear sesión de pago (válido) -> 201 con id y url de Checkout
POST {{base}}/create-payment-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ord-1",
  "currency": "usd",
  "items": [
    { "name": "Producto", "price": 20, "quantity": 1 },
    { "name": "Envío", "price": 4.99, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. Inválido: sin items -> 400
POST {{base}}/create-payment-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ord-1",
  "currency": "usd"
}

### 3. Inválido: precio negativo -> 400
POST {{base}}/create-payment-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ord-1",
  "currency": "usd",
  "items": [{ "name": "Producto", "price": -20, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 4. Inválido: campos extra -> 400
POST {{base}}/create-payment-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ord-1",
  "currency": "usd",
  "descuento": 50,
  "items": [{ "name": "Producto", "price": 20, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 5. Webhook sin firma válida -> 400
POST {{base}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
stripe-signature: t=123,v1=firma-falsa

{ "type": "charge.succeeded", "data": { "object": { "metadata": { "orderId": "ord-trucho" } } } }

### 6. Redirects de Checkout
GET {{base}}/success

###
GET {{base}}/cancel
